  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra"><head>Φαίδρα</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="603_604" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-603_604" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:624">
            <note type="source">Stobæus Eclog. phys. I, 6. p. 174.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">α. Ἔζης ἄρ᾽ οὐδὲ γῆς ἔνερθ᾽ ᾤχου θανών;</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">β. οὐ γὰρ πρὸ μοίρας ἡ τύχη βιάζεται.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Σ. ἐκ Φαίδρας. Hoc lemma in aliquot codicibus adscriptum est poetæ fortasse alius loco ibidem p. 172. “Περιώσι᾽ ἄφυκτά τε μήδεα παντοδαπᾶν βουλᾶν ἀδαμαντίναις ὑφαίνεται κερκίσιν Αἶσα.”</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="605" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-605" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:616">
            <note type="source">Stobæus XVII, 2.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐ γὰρ δίκαιον ἄνδρα γενναῖον φρένας</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">τέρπειν, ὅπου μὴ καὶ δίκαια τέρψεται.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="606" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-606" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:622">
            <note type="source">Stobæus XLIII, 5. et omisso nomine fabulæ scholiasta Luciani vol. II. p. 336.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐ γάρ ποτ᾽ ἂν γένοιτ᾽ ἂν ἀσφαλὴς πόλις,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἐν ᾗ τὰ μὲν δίκαια καὶ τὰ σώφρονα</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">λάγδην πατεῖται, κωτίλος δ᾽ ἀνὴρ λαβὼν</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">πανούργα χερσὶ κέντρα κηδεύει πόλιν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="607" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-607" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.pearson1917-grc1:684">
            <note type="source">Stobæus LXIII, 25.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἔρως γὰρ ἄνδρας οὐ μόνους ἐπέρχεται,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ αὖ γυναῖκας, ἀλλὰ καὶ θεῶν ἄνω</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">ψυχὰς χαράσσει κἀπὶ πόντον ἔρχεται.</l>
              <l n="4" xml:lang="grc">καὶ τόνδ᾽ ἀπείργειν οὐδ᾽ ὁ παγκρατὴς σθένει</l>
              <l n="5" xml:lang="grc">Ζεὺς, ἀλλ᾽ ὑπείκει καὶ θέλων ἐγκλίνεται.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Tres primos versus Euripidi tribuit Clemens Alex. Strom. VI. p. 745. et v. 3. ταράσσει præbet.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="608" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-608" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.pearson1917-grc1:682">
            <note type="source">Stobæus LXIX, 14.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὕτω γυναικὸς οὐδὲν ἂν μεῖζον κακὸν</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">κακῆς ἀνὴρ κτήσαιτ᾽ ἂν, οὐδὲ σώφρονος</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">κρείσσον· παθὼν δ᾽ ἕκαστος ὧν τύχῃ λέγει.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="609" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-609" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.pearson1917-grc1:679">
            <note type="source">Stobæus LXXIV, 16.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Σύγγνωτε κἀνάσχεσθε σιγῶσαι. τὸ γὰρ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">γυναιξὶν αἰσχρὸν σὺν γυναικὶ δεῖ στέγειν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Grotius ἐν γυναιξὶ δεῖ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="610" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-610" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.pearson1917-grc1:681">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CV, 39.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τὸ δ᾽ εὐτυχοῦντα πάντ᾽ ἀριθμῆσαι βροτῶν,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">οὐκ ἔστιν ὄντως ὅντιν᾽ εὑρήσεις ἕνα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="611" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-611" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:619">
            <note type="source">Stobæus CVIII, 53.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Αἴσχη μὲν, ὦ γυναῖκες, οὐδ᾽ ἂν εἶς φύγοι</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">βροτῶν ποθ᾽, ᾧ καὶ Ζεὺς ἐφορμήσοι κακά.</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">νόσους δ᾽ ἀνάγκη τὰς θεηλάτους φέρειν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="612" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-612" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:623">
            <note type="source">Grammaticus Bekkeri p. 338, 15.</note>
            <quote>Ἀγκῦφαι· ἐκ μεταφορᾶς αἱ ἀσφάλειαι. Σοφοκλῆς</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ εἰσὶ μητρὶ παῖδες ἄγκυραι βίου.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Nomen fabulæ, Φαίδρᾳ, addunt Hesychius in ἄγκυραι et Suidas in χαλάσω, sed versum omittunt.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="613" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-613" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἆγος· ἅγνισμα θυσίας. Σ. Φαίδρα.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="614" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-614" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:626">
            <note type="source">Etymolog. M. p. 19, 53.</note>
            <quote>Καὶ ἀελλάδες φωναὶ παρὰ Σοφοκλεῖ ἐν Φαίδρᾳ.</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Ita codex Leidensis apud Valckenar. ad Hippol. p. 291. Vulgo ἄελλαι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="615" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-615" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:628">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἄκλεπτοι· οὐ παραλογιζόμενοι, ἀληθεῖς. Σ. Φαίδρα.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="616" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-616" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἀπέπτυσε λόγους· ἀπεμύξατο τοὺς λόγους. ἀντὶ τοῦ ἀπεστράφη. Σ. Φαίδρα.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="617" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-617" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:629">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Αὐτομόλως· προδοτικῶς. Σ. Φαίδρα.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="618" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-618" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:630">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἀψεφές· ἀφρόντιστον. Σ. Φαίδρᾳ.</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Nomen fabulæ om. grammaticus Bekkeri p. 476, 1.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="619" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-619" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:625">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Κυλλαίνων κάτω· Σ. Φαίδρα. τὰ ὦτα καταβαλὼν, ὅπερ (codex ἅπερ) οἱ σαίνοντες (κύνες add. Hemsterh.) ποιοῦσιν</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἔσαιν᾽ ἐπ᾽ οὐρὰν ὦτα κυλλαίνων κάτω.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Codex ἔσται ἐποὐρανὦτικυθλάννων καὶ τὸ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="620" xml:id="fragment-phaidra-dindorf1893_grc1-620" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phaidra" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phaidra.nauck1889grc1:631">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Μῶλυς· ὁ ἀμαθής. Σ. Φαίδρα μεμωλυσμένη, παρειμένη.</quote>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
